{"id":"wb-3-118","name":"夏鲁寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"夏鲁寺","text":"夏鲁寺，藏语称“夏鲁贡巴”（藏语：ཞ་ལུ་དགོན་པ，威利转写：zha lu dgon pa）位于中国西藏自治区日喀则市桑珠孜区甲措雄乡，是一座藏传佛教夏鲁派寺院，也是夏鲁派的祖寺。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%8F%E9%B2%81%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94680386,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94680386","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fd2891f3fad40089091232ec.jpg","title":"Shalu_Monastery_Shigatse_Tibet_China_西藏_日喀则_夏鲁寺_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shalu_Monastery_Shigatse_Tibet_China_%E8%A5%BF%E8%97%8F_%E6%97%A5%E5%96%80%E5%88%99_%E5%A4%8F%E9%B2%81%E5%AF%BA_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/Shalu_Monastery_Shigatse_Tibet_China_%E8%A5%BF%E8%97%8F_%E6%97%A5%E5%96%80%E5%88%99_%E5%A4%8F%E9%B2%81%E5%AF%BA_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Hiroki Ogawa","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Shalu Monastery Shigatse Tibet China 西藏 日喀则 夏鲁寺","width":320,"height":240}}